- Execute command: "echo ''Hello, CLI!''"
- Verify output contains "Hello, CLI!"

# Test Python Executor Tool
- Execute Python code: "print(''Hello, Python!'')"
- Verify output contains "Hello, Python!"

# Test Python Executor Tool with complex code
- Execute Python code to calculate fibonacci sequence
- Verify the output is correct

# Test Browser Tool
- Open URL: "https://example.com"
- Verify the browser opens the page

# Test HTTP Server Tool
- Start HTTP server on port 8080
- Verify the server is running
- Stop the HTTP server

# Test SubAgent Tool
- Spawn sub-agent with task: "Write a simple hello world program in Python"
- Verify the sub-agent completes the task
- Verify the generated code is correct
```', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 'xxx/apps/agentskills-runtime/skills/test-cli-tools', 'synced', '2026-09-26 10:31:38+08');
