- Verify the response status and content

### 2. Test HTTP POST Request
- Send a POST request with JSON data
- Verify the response

### 3. Test HTTP PUT Request
- Send a PUT request to update data
- Verify the response

### 4. Test HTTP DELETE Request
- Send a DELETE request
- Verify the response

### 5. Test HTTP Headers
- Send a request with custom headers
- Verify the headers are correctly sent

### 6. Test HTTP Authentication
- Send a request with authentication
- Verify the authentication works

## Tools Required
- HttpTool

## Usage Example

```
# Test HTTP GET request
- Send GET request to https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
- Verify response status is 200
- Verify response contains expected data

